cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference or implement the ZLITS contract, please cite it as below."
title: "ZLITS — Zimbabwe Livestock Identification & Traceability System: open API contract"
abstract: >-
  An open, vendor-neutral national livestock registry API contract for animal identity,
  movement and health events. The contract, examples and conformance suite are licensed
  Apache-2.0; the "ZLITS" name and conformance mark are protected, and the national herd
  data and the mandate belong to the State.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The ZLITS steward"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/retrocraftdevops/zlits"
url: "https://lits.africa"
version: "1.6.0-draft"
keywords:
  - livestock traceability
  - livestock identification
  - national registry
  - animal health
  - movement permits
  - OpenAPI
  - Zimbabwe
  - Africa
